[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, read \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading Manifest's W10 requirements; the plans say several choices\u001b[70Gmust\u001b[75Gbe\u001b[78Gsettled\u001b[86Gbefore\u001b[93Gimplementation,\u001b[109Gso\u001b[112GI'm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchecking\u001b[12Gwhich\u001b[18Gare\u001b[22Galready\u001b[30Gdecided.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patte\u001b[25Gns, read\u001b[34Gng \u001b[1m2\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[46Glisting\u001b[54G\u001b[1m3\u001b[56G\u001b[22mdirectories\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 32s\u001b[39m…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/projects/manifest/source/game/travel/include/manifest/travel/Travel.h\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←  ☒ Executor \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Cost split \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ☐ Policy edits  ☐ Scope  ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mHow is a cargo lot's cost attributed when it sells in parts (for the cost-recovering sale floor and the loss \r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m│\u001b[3G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mallowance)?\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mProportional, ceil (Recommended)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mThe lot carries its settled cost (fills' gross + fees, whole credits). Each partial sale's floor is the remaining \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bcost × sold/remaining totes, rounded up;\u001b[47Gthe\u001b[51Glast\u001b[56Gsale takes the rest. One\u001b[81Gallowance counter p\u001b[101Gr lot, sp\u001b[111Gnt by each\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bshortfall,\u001b[17Gs\u001b[19G splitting can't\u001b[36Gmul\u001b[40Giply i\u001b[47G.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1BP\u001b[8Gr-tote\u001b[15Gaverage\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mFloor\u001b[12G= \u001b[15Geil(cost / tot\u001b[30Gs) p\u001b[35Gr tot\u001b[41G, f\u001b[45Gxed at purchas\u001b[60G. Simpler,\u001b[71Gbut rounding up per\u001b[91Gt\u001b[93Gte can o\u001b[102Gerst\u001b[107Gte the floor \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bby up\u001b[12Gto a \u001b[18Gredit a to\u001b[29Ge.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[15;1H"]
