[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading Manifest's W10 requirements; the plans say several choices\u001b[70Gmust\u001b[75Gbe\u001b[78Gsettled\u001b[86Gbefore\u001b[93Gimplementation,\u001b[109Gso\u001b[112GI'm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchecking\u001b[12Gwhich\u001b[18Gare\u001b[22Galready\u001b[30Gdecided.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m patte\u001b[25Gns, read\u001b[34Gng \u001b[1m2\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[46Glisting\u001b[54G\u001b[1m3\u001b[56G\u001b[22mdirectories\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 1m 22s\u001b[39m…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/projects/manifest/source/game/travel/include/manifest/travel/Travel.h\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←  ☒ Executor  ☒ Cost split  ☒ Policy edits \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Scope \u001b[39m\u001b[49m ✔ Submit  →\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mWhat do 'autopilot' and 'NPC jobs' mean for W10's first cut?\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m❯\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m1.\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSame executor, no scouting (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAutopilot = the auto-trader's travel, no separate route mode. NPC trading companies are authored per scenario (one \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mship each in the fixture) and run the same policy executor with their own observations. Unknown markets are \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bskipped, not scouted.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mAdd a standing route\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAs above, plus autopilot as a player-authored loop of venues with buy/sell instructions at each, apart from \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bprofit-seeking\u001b[21Gchoice.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B Add scouting\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAs the first, plus sending an idle ship to an unknown market to gain a report (needs a scouting choice rule, open \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153min the plans).\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m4. Type something.\r\u001b[1B────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m5.\u001b[6GChat\u001b[11Gabout\u001b[17Gthis\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[12;1H"]
