[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · What runs a standing trade policy (a player's ship while they're away, and an NPC company's)? → Native system \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How is a cargo lot's cost attributed when it sells in parts (for the cost-recovering sale floor and the loss \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Ball\u001b[11Gance)? → Prop\u001b[25Grtional,\u001b[34Gceil (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· When a player edits a standing\u001b[39Gpolicy while its ship holds cargo, when does the change apply? → At the next \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bdecision\u001b[15G(Recomm\u001b[23Gnded)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· What do 'autopilot' and 'NPC jobs' mean for W10's first cut? → Same executor, no scouting (Recommended)\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mChoices\u001b[11Gsettled,\u001b[20Gall\u001b[24Gfour\u001b[29Gas\u001b[32Grecommended.\u001b[45GNow\u001b[49Greading\u001b[57Gthe\u001b[61GManifest\u001b[70Gcode\u001b[75GW10\u001b[79Gbuilds\u001b[86Gon:\u001b[90Gworld\u001b[96Gstate,\u001b[103Grequests,\u001b[113Gbrokers,\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gobservation an\u001b[18G travel.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m8\u001b[22m files, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mFound\u001b[9Gthe\u001b[13Gengine\u001b[20Galready\u001b[28Ghas\u001b[32G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSimWorld::Apply\u001b[48G\u001b[39mfor\u001b[52Gcommands\u001b[61Ga\u001b[63Gsystem\u001b[70Gsends,\u001b[77Gso\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gexecutor\u001b[93Glikely\u001b[100Gneeds\u001b[106Gno\u001b[109Gengine\u001b[116Gedit.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3GChecking how fills are recorded, so a cargo lot can c\u001b[57Grry\u001b[61Git\u001b[64G