1b[34G's\u001b[37Grequest meets, with no sequence number, and isn't recorded, because a replay\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bproduces\u001b[14Gthose commands again.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPolicy, per ship:\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest.Policy.Set\u001b[43G\u001b[39mturns\u001b[49Git\u001b[52Gon\u001b[55Gor\u001b[58Goff\u001b[62Gand\u001b[66Gsets\u001b[71Gtwo\u001b[75Gwhole-credit\u001b[88Gamounts,\u001b[97Gboth\u001b[102G0\u001b[104Gby\u001b[107Gdefault:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtargetProfit\u001b[39m: a\u001b[23Gtrade starts only if its es\u001b[51Gimate beats it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mlossAllowance\u001b[39m: how far below\u001b[36Gcost\u001b[41Ga sale\u001b[48Gmay go.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mJob, saved on the ship:\u001b[22m choose\u001b[36G→ fly to the source\u001b[56G→\u001b[58Gbuy\u001b[62G→\u001b[64Gfly\u001b[68Gto\u001b[71Gthe\u001b[75Gdestination\u001b[87G→\u001b[89Gsell,\u001b[95Gor\u001b[98Gblocked.\u001b[107GThe\u001b[111Glot\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gcarries the cost its fills actually paid, fees included.\u001b[62G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mChoosing a trade:\u001b[22m it\u001b[26Guses only the owner's\u001b[76Gnknown\u001b[83Gmarket\u001b[90Ggives\u001b[96Gnothing.\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
