ion to run only when a covered market actua\u001b[61Gly changes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThese are rec\u001b[19Grded\u001b[24Gin D-097\u001b[33Gand the \"W10 plan\" section of the stage-4\u001b[75Gplan.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat slice 1 adds:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mRequests::Act\u001b[39m runs\u001b[24Ga\u001b[26Gcommand\u001b[34Gfor\u001b[38Gan\u001b[41Gactor\u001b[47Gstraight\u001b[56Gaway,\u001b[62Gwith\u001b[67Gno\u001b[70Gsequence\u001b[79Gnumber,\u001b[87Gledger\u001b[94Gor\u001b[97Grecording.\u001b[108GIt's\u001b[113Ghow\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gexecutor will\u001b[19Gse\u001b[22Gd\u001b[24Gthe same commands a playe\u001b[50G does.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Policy\u001b[19G\u001b[39mand \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Job\u001b[39m are saved\u001b[44Gon the\u001b[51Gship and\u001b[60Gchecked\u001b[68Gwhen\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gsave\u001b[80Gloads.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mManifest.Policy.Set\u001b[39m lets only the ship's own\u001b[50Gr set\u001b[56Gits\u001b[60Gpolicy.\u001b[68GAn edit leaves the\u001b[87Gjob\u001b[91Gand\u001b[95Gits\u001b[99Gcargo\u001b[105Gwhere\u001b[111Gthey\u001b[116Gare,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gand allowance already spent stays\u001b[40Gpent.\u001b[46G \u001b[76G\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
