[0.022, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G  can't start the journey, so it never goes overdrawn.\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BHolding: a\u001b[18G2-credit berth fee for each simulation hour a ship stays dock\u001b[80Gd. Any\u001b[87Ghing\u001b[92Gthe company can't pay is\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1Brried \u001b[16Gs arr\u001b[22Gars a\u001b[28Gd taken first at the\u001b[49Gnext hour\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BEach charge is attri\u001b[28Guted\u001b[33Gto the cargo\u001b[46Glot it serves, counted\u001b[69Gin the profit\u001b[83Gestimate, and recovered in\u001b[110Gthe\u001b[114Gminimum\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bs\u001b[9Gle price.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mW18\u001b[22m, rig\u001b[14Gt after\u001b[22GW10 \u001b[27Gn Manifes\u001b[37G's\u001b[40Gdelivery order, s\u001b[58Gttles th\u001b[67G charges' \u001b[78Geal amounts and bases, plus storag\u001b[114Gfees,\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Btolls and the\u001b[19Gcost\u001b[24Gof\u001b[27Glife\u001b[32Gsupport\u001b[40Gused\u001b[45Gin\u001b[48Gtransit.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mL2\u001b[10G\u001b[22mbooked s\u001b[19Graight\u001b[26Gafter W10, looks at why a docked f\u001b[62Get stops th\u001b[74G fast-forward from skipping step\u001b[107G. The aim is\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[7Gr observation to\u001b[24Grun only when a\u001b[40Gcovered\u001b[48Gmarket actually\u001b[64Gchanges.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BThese are reco\u001b[20Gded in D-097 and\u001b[37Gthe \"W10\u001b[46Gplan\"\u001b[52Gse\u001b[55Gtion of \u001b[64Ghe stage-4\u001b[75Gplan.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWhat slice 1 adds:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mRequests::Act\u001b[19G\u001b[39mruns\u001b[24Ga\u001b[26Gcommand\u001b[34Gfor\u001b[38Gan\u001b[41Gactor\u001b[47Gstraight\u001b[56Gaway,\u001b[62Gwith\u001b[67Gno\u001b[70Gsequence\u001b[79Gnumber,\u001b[87Gledger\u001b[94Gor\u001b[97Grecording.\u001b[108GIt's\u001b[113Ghow\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  executor w