[0.046, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m     +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mnction's, `Policy::Charges`: the                                                                      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m984\u001b[13G\u001b[22m destination's\u001b[28Gdocking\u001b[36Gfee,\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gsource's\u001b[58Gif\u001b[61Gthe\u001b[65Gship\u001b[70Gmust\u001b[75Gfly\u001b[79Gthere\u001b[85Gfirst.\u001b[92GA\u001b[94Glot\u001b[98Gkeeps\u001b[104Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 985 \u001b[22m   charges attributed to it as they fall (`charges`, whole credits: its journeys' docking fees and\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 986 \u001b[22m   its berth hours), and its sale floor recovers them with its cost. Their real amounts and bases,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Found \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m new diagnostic issue in 1 file (ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mArrears will be subject to interest rate charges on outstanding amounts, which will be charged daily and accumulate \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwith the principle in arears. The game should set a max threshhold rate considered 'ursury' to prevent players going \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mabove certain amounts e.g. a max of 35% compounded daily.\u001b[39m                                                             \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI'm adding arrears interest\u001b[31Gat\u001b[34G35%\u001b[38Gas\u001b[41Gan\u001b[44Gannual\u001b[51Grate\u001b[56Gcompounded\u001b[67Gdaily,\u001b[74Gand\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gvenue\u001b[88Goperator\u001b[97Gsets\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Grate\u001b[111Gwithin\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[1B  game's usury cap. I'm waiting on the build next.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest' && cmake --build build/clang-debug -j24 2>&1 | grep -E \"error|warning:|FAILED\" \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m| head -40\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;218;124;92mMarinating…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mthought for 18s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
