[0.433, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 116 \u001b[22m | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-098\"\u001b[39m></a>D-098 | Owners set the charges on what they hold, and a region's governor its taxe\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22ms: \u001b[17Gstation's operator its\u001b[40Gdocking and b\u001b[54Grt\u001b[57G fe\u001b[62G, a\u001b[67Garehouse's owner its\u001b[88Gstorage fee, a gate'\u001b[110Gown\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Br its \u001b[19Goll and\u001b[27Ga carrier its fre\u001b[45Gght rates, and the\u001b[64Gorg\u001b[68Gnisation g\u001b[79Gverning a region\u001b[96Gth\u001b[99G t\u001b[102Gx rate\u001b[111Gn i\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bts populace. Each is a saved\u001b[41Gvalue on th\u001b[53G thi\u001b[58Gg\u001b[60Gc\u001b[62Garged, pos\u001b[73Ged to anyone who might\u001b[96Gpay\u001b[100Git,\u001b[104Gse\u001b[107G by its\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B owner's \u001b[22Gommand and\u001b[34Gppli\u001b[41Gto charges af\u001b[55Ger the change, nev\u001b[74Gr\u001b[79Go\u001b[81Ge paid \u001b[89Gr a booking accep\u001b[107Ged (D-0\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B41). What goes unpaid is arrears to the\u001b[52Gcreditor,\u001b[63Gompounding daily at\u001b[83Gthe creditor's own rate up\u001b[110Gto t\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bhe game's\u001b[22Gusury lim\u001b[32Gt\u001b[34G(`b\u001b[38Glance.yaml`'s\u001b[52G`charges.maxArrearsRateBps`, 35% a\u001b[87Gyear). An AI owner sets its\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B own by rule, and the\u001b[34Gclient shows and edits a player's later. | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mDelivery order: W18 and L29\u001b[39m](deliver\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1By-order.md#priority-5-stage-4-trading-automation-\u001b[62Gnd-regional-development) | selected (2026-11-21, the\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B user's); W10 stores each venue's fees a\u001b[53G the\u001b[58Gr defaults, \u001b[71Gothing sets them yet | Manifest, W\u001b[106G0, W18,\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1BL29 |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m117\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-099\"\u001b[39m></a>D-099\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GRegions\u001b[48Grun\u001b[52Gon\u001b[55Gcredit,\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Gcreditors\u001b[77Ggain\u001b[82Gpower\u001b[88Gover\u001b[93Gthem:\u001b[99Ga\u001b[101Gregion's\u001b[110Ghous\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22meholds and treasury may buy\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gr esse\u001b[51Gtials beyond thei\u001b[69G funds,\u001b[77Gthe unpaid\u001b[88Gpart\u001b[93Gcarried\u001b[101Gas debt to th\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1B seller or a lender, which\u001b[43G cr\u001b[47Gditor charg\u001b[59Gs inter\u001b[67Gst\u001b[70Gon \u001b[74Gaily at its own \u001b[91Gate up to\u001b[101Gthe usury lim\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bit (D-098),\u001b[24Gso a government\u001b[40Gcan\u001b[44Gfe\u001b[48G its\u001b[53Gpeopl\u001b[59G through bad times and\u001b[82Gcan\u001b[86Galso spiral\u001b[98Ginto debt it\u001b[111Gcan\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bnot pay. A merchant class of trading\u001b[49Gcompanies (players' \u001b[70Gnd NPC\u001b[77G') selling t\u001b[91Gregions on cr\u001b[105Gdit, and\u001b[K\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Ba banking class lending to regions and companies, control region\u001b[77G indirectly th\u001b[92Gough that\u001b[102Gdebt. Wh\u001b[111Gt d\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bebt gives\u001b[22Gits ho\u001b[29Gder (pri\u001b[38Grity \u001b[44Gf repayment, collateral, concessions, influence \u001b[93Gver\u001b[99Ge governor) an\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B what d\u001b[20Gfault\u001b[26Gd\u001b[28Ges are open. |\u001b[43G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mDelivery order: L30\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#later-pri\u001b[93Grities-and-re-entry-c\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bondi\u001b[17Gions) | sel\u001b[29Gcted (2026-11-21, \u001b[75G in detail | Man\u001b[92Gfes\u001b[96G, L30 |\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
