[0.150, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[8Gtill \u001b[14Gp\u001b[16Gn: what holding\u001b[32Ga regi\u001b[39Gn's\u001b[43Gdebt \u001b[49Gives the credit\u001b[66G, and what happens\u001b[85Gon\u001b[88Gdefault.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSlice 2 (now at nominal values):\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFees per venue:\u001b[21G\u001b[22meach\u001b[26Gvenue\u001b[32Ghas\u001b[36Gits\u001b[40Gown\u001b[44Gfees\u001b[49G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Fees\u001b[39m),\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67GW18\u001b[71Gcan\u001b[75Glet\u001b[79Goperators\u001b[89Gchange\u001b[96Gthem.\u001b[102GThey\u001b[107Gstart\u001b[113Gat\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  defaults in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbalance.yaml\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDocking fe\u001b[16G:\u001b[22m 10\u001b[21Gcredits, paid to the destination as a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTravel\u001b[39m starts. If \u001b[78Ghe company\u001b[90Gan't cov\u001b[99Gr it plu\u001b[108G the\u001b[113Gship's\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Barrears,\u001b[14Gthe journey is refused\u001b[37Gwith\u001b[42G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFunds\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBerth fee:\u001b[22m 2\u001b[18Gcredits per\u001b[30Gsimulation hour for each docked ship, paid to i\u001b[78Gs venue. Whatever th\u001b[99G company can't pay\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbecome\u001b[12G the ship's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Arrears\u001b[39m \u001b[40Go\u001b[42Gthat venue. Arrears\u001b[62Gmust\u001b[67Gbe\u001b[70Gpaid\u001b[75Gin\u001b[78Gfull\u001b[83Gbefore\u001b[90Gthe\u001b[94Gship\u001b[99Gcan\u001b[103Gleave.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mInterest:\u001b[22m arrears com\u001b[27Gound daily at\u001b[41Gthe venue's rate, 10% a year by\u001b[73Gdefault, \u001b[83Gever above the 35% limit. Fractions\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba \u001b[8Gredit carry over to the next day,\u001b[42Gso small debts still accru\u001b[69G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mPins:\u001b[22m the\u001