[0.399, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFees per venue:\u001b[22m eac\u001b[25G venue\u001b[32Ghas its own fees (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Fees\u001b[39m), so W18 can let o\u001b[82Grat\u001b[86Grs ch\u001b[92Gnge them.\u001b[102GThey\u001b[107Gstart\u001b[113Gat\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdefaults\u001b[14Gin\u001b[17G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbalance.yaml\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mDocking fee:\u001b[22m 10 credits, paid to\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gdestination\u001b[54Gas\u001b[57Ga\u001b[59G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTravel\u001b[66G\u001b[39mstarts.\u001b[74GIf\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gcompany\u001b[89Gcan't\u001b[95Gcover\u001b[101Git\u001b[104Gplus\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gship's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Garrears, the journey\u001b[26Gis r\u001b[31Gfused with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFunds\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBerth fee:\u001b[22m 2 credits per simulation\u001b[41Ghour\u001b[46Gfor\u001b[50Geach\u001b[55Gdocked\u001b[62Gship,\u001b[68Gpaid\u001b[73Gto\u001b[76Gits\u001b[80Gvenue.\u001b[87GWhatever\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gcompany\u001b[108Gcan't\u001b[114Gpay\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbecomes the ship's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Arrears\u001b[39m to\u001b[42Gtha\u001b[46G venue.\u001b[54GArrears must be paid in full before the ship can leave.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mInterest:\u001b[22m arrears compound daily a\u001b[40G the venue's rate, 10%\u001b[63Ga\u001b[65Gyear\u001b[70Gby\u001b[73Gdefault,\u001b[82Gnever\u001b[88Gabove\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98G35%\u001b[102Glimit.\u001b[109GFractions\u001b[119Gof\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Ga credit carry over to the next day, so small debts still accrue.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mPins:\u001b[22m the \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcompany\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfixtu\u001b[33Ge\u001b[39m pinned\u001b[42Ghashes moved. With the charges at zero and the new components unr\u001b[108Ggistere