[0.377, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BSo a\u001b[12Ggovernment c\u001b[25Gn feed i\u001b[34Gs people through a bad patch, o\u001b[66G spiral into \u001b[80Gebt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BThat debt is \u001b[21Gow\u001b[24Ga merchant class an\u001b[44G a banking class cont\u001b[66Gol regions\u001b[77Gindirectly.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GStill\u001b[13Gopen:\u001b[19Gwhat\u001b[24Gholding\u001b[32Ga\u001b[34Gregion's\u001b[43Gdebt\u001b[48Ggives\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gcreditor,\u001b[68Gand\u001b[72Gwhat\u001b[77Ghappens\u001b[85Gon\u001b[88Gdefault.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSlic\u001b[8G 2 (now at nominal values):\u001b[36G\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFees per venue:\u001b[22m each venue\u001b[32Ghas\u001b[36Gits\u001b[40Gown\u001b[44Gfees\u001b[49G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Fees\u001b[39m),\u001b[64Gso\u001b[67GW18\u001b[71Gcan\u001b[75Glet\u001b[79Goperators\u001b[89Gchange\u001b[96Gthem.\u001b[102GThey\u001b[107Gstart\u001b[113Gat\u001b[116Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gdefaults in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbalance.yaml\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDocking fee:\u001b[18G\u001b[22m10 cr\u001b[24Gdit\u001b[28G, paid to the\u001b[42Gdestination as a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mTravel\u001b[66G\u001b[39mstarts.\u001b[74GIf\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gcompany\u001b[89Gcan't\u001b[95Gcover\u001b[101Git\u001b[104Gplus\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gship's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Garrears, the\u001b[18Gjourney\u001b[26Gis refused with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInsufficientFunds\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mBerth fee:\u001b[22m 2 credits per simulation hour for each docked\u001b[62Gship, paid to its venu\u001b[85G. Wha\u001b[91Gever the company can't\u001b[114Gpay\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbecomes the ship's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mWorld::Arrears\u001b[39m \u001b[40Go that venue. Arrears must be\u001b[70Gpai\u001b[74G in full before th\u0