[0.067, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m1005 +\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m for or goods it could not move), the step it first blocked at (kept across retries that change     \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1006 +\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m nothing), the lot's charges so far and the chosen trade's `estimate` are the player's to see       \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1007 +\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m through the query's ship view and on reconnect.                                                    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 1008 \u001b[22m - **NPC jobs.** A scenario's `traders` name NPC principals and their companies, provisioned in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1009 \u001b[22m   initial state through `Company::Provision` at the starter venue, each ship given an enabled policy,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1010 \u001b[22m   their principals marked `World::Npc`, for which `manifest-token` issues no token. They read\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m lines, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  997 \u001b[22m   bought loaded. **Selling**, docked at the destination: the lot unloaded and offered at the lowest\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  998 \u001b[22m   limit whose fills, however the book splits them in up to `kMaxFills`, net the floor's share of the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  999 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mtotes\u001b[21Gsold\u001b[26G(each\u001b[32Gfill's\u001b[39Gnearest-credit\u001b[54Ggross\u001b[60Gand\u001b[64Grounded-up\u001b[75Gfee\u001b[79Gmay\u001b[83Gcost\u001b[88G1.5\u001b[92Gcredits\u001b[100Gagainst\u001b[108Gone\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1000 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  price); the rest cancelled, a shortfall spending the allowance, and what is unsold loaded back.    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1000 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  price; `Policy::SellLimit`); the rest cancelled, a shortfall below the sale's share of the whole   \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1001 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  floor spending at most the allowance left, and what is unsold loaded back.                         \u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 1002 \u001b[22m   Par\u001b[19Gial sa\u001b[27Gs sh\u001b[32Gre the lot's\u001b[45Gcost proportionally,\u001b[66Grounded\u001b[74Gup,\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Glast\u001b[87Gtaking\u001b[94Gthe\u001b[98Grest.\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1003 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Blocked.**\u001b[28GIt\u001b[31Gkeeps\u001b[37Gits\u001b[41Gcargo\u001b[47Gand\u001b[51Greconsiders\u001b[63Gat\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gnext\u001b[75Geconomic\u001b[84Gturn's\u001b[91Glast\u001b[96Gstep\u001b[101G(every\u001b[108G60\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1004 \u001b[15G\u001b[22msimulation\u001b[26Gseconds,\u001b[35Gafter\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Grequote),\u001b[55Gno\u001b[58Gsooner,\u001b[66Gsince\u001b[72Ga\u001b[74Gturn\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gminute:\u001b[92Gno\u001b[95Gwake\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gan\u001b[106Gowner's\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;230;149;117mConcocting…\u001b[16G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m13m 26s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m62.3k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[7B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
