hortfall spending the allowance, and what is unsold loaded back.    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1000 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  price; `Policy::SellLimit`); the rest cancelled, a shortfall below the sale's share of the whole   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1001 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  floor spending at most the allowance left, and what is unsold loaded back.                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 1002 \u001b[22m   Partial sales share the lot's cost proportionally, rounded up, the last taking the rest.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1003 \u001b[22m - **Blocked.** It keeps its cargo and reconsiders at the next economic turn's last step (every 60\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m4\u001b[15G\u001b[22msimul\u001b[21Gtion seconds,\u001b[35Gafter \u001b[42Ghe\u001b[45Grequote), no sooner\u001b[66Gsince a\u001b[74Gturn is\u001b[82Ga minute: no wake on an\u001b[106Gowner's\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning the\u001b[15Ggate.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
