[0.052, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manif\u001b[27Gst/docs/stage-4-trading-plan.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m2\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines, remov\u001b[28G \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m7\u001b[15G\u001b[22mbought l\u001b[24Gaded. **Selling**, docked at the destination: the lot un\u001b[81Goaded and of\u001b[94Gered at the l\u001b[108Gwest\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[15G\u001b[22mlimit\u001b[21Gwhose fills, however the book splits them in \u001b[67Gp to `kMaxFills`, net the floor's share of the\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  999 \u001b[22m   totes sold (each fill's nearest-credit gross and rounded-up fee may cost 1.5 credits against one\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1000 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  price); the rest cancelled, a shortfall spending the allowance, and what is unsold loaded back.    \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m0\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mprice; `Pol\u001b[27Gcy::SellLimit`); the rest cancelled, \u001b[65G shortfal\u001b[75G below the sale's\u001b[93Gshare\u001b[99Gof\u001b[102Gthe\u001b[106Gwhole\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1001 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  floor spending at most the allowance left, and what is unsold loaded back.                         \r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22m \u001b[15GPartial sales shar\u001b[34G the lot's cost p\u001b[52Gop\u001b[55Grt\u001b[58Gonally,\u001b[66Ground\u001b[72Gd up, the last taking \u001b[95Ghe rest.\u001b[K\r\u001b[9C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Blocked.** It keeps its\u001b[41Gcargo and reco\u001b[56Gsiders at\u001b[66Gthe next economic\u001b[84Gturn's last st\u001b[99Gp (every 60\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1004 \u001b[15G\u001b[22msimulation\u001b[26Gseconds,\u001b[35Gafter\u001b[41Gthe\u001b[45Grequote),\u001b[55Gno\u001b[58Gsooner,\u001b[66Gsince\u001b[72Ga\u001b[74Gturn\u001b[79Gis\u001b[82Ga\u001b[84Gminute:\u001b[92Gno\u001b[95Gwake\u001b[100Gon\u001b[103Gan\u001b[106Gowner's\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11Gthe\u001b[15Ggate.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, ran \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m shell commands \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mGate passed, including tidy. Committing slice 3.\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
