[1.022, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bcargo kept when no bid\u001b[28Gcovers\u001b[35Gthe\u001b[39Gfloor;\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba partial sal\u001b[19G with no\u001b[28Gallowance never going\u001b[50Gbelow\u001b[56Gits\u001b[60Gshare;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bn \u001b[9Gllowance spread\u001b[25Gover sales, retries and a save/load, never\u001b[68Gexceeded;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B po\u001b[10Gicy edit taking effect at th\u001b[39G next\u001b[45Gdecision;\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bchange\u001b[14Gin a\u001b[19Gm\u001b[21Grket\u001b[26Gthe owner\u001b[36Ghasn't seen leaving\u001b[56Gthe\u001b[60Gdecision\u001b[69Galone.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSeen in an exploratory run:\u001b[31G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[35Gjob\u001b[39Gmade\u001b[44Gseveral\u001b[52Gprofitable\u001b[63Ground\u001b[69Gtrips\u001b[75Gfrom\u001b[80G25,000\u001b[87Gcredits.\u001b[96GOne\u001b[100Gjourney\u001b[108Ginto\u001b[113GOre\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfailed with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mPadLost\u001b[39m, which com\u001b[34Gs fro\u001b[40G the trave\u001b[52Gcode (not changed here). The job blocked, retried and sold, but paid\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bthe dock\u001b[12Gng\u001b[15Gfee a second time. Whether a failed journey's fee is refunded\u001b[77Gis now noted in th\u001b[96G plan\u001b[103Gs a W18 decision.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[9G\u001b[22mslice\u001b[15G4,\u001b[18Gthe\u001b[22GNPC\u001b[26Gtraders:\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtraders\u001b[45G\u001b[39mlist\u001b[50Gin\u001b[53Gthe\u001b[57Gscenario,\u001b[67Gprovisioned\u001b[79Gat\u001b[82Gstart,\u001b[89GNPC\u001b[93Gprincipals\u001b[104Gmarked\u001b[111Gso\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btoken\u001b[9Gtool won'\u001b[19G issue\u001b[27Ghem tokens. It's mostly mec\u001b[55Gani\u001b[59Gal, s\u001b[65G Sonnet at high effo\u001b[87G should do; Opu\u001b[104Gisn't needed.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BThe\u001b[7Gcontext\u001b[15Gis\u001b[18Glarge\