[0.117, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m lines, removed\u001b[29G\u001b[1m3\u001b[31G\u001b[22mlines\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1007 \u001b[15G\u001b[22mnothing),\u001b[25Gthe\u001b[29Glot's\u001b[35Gcharges\u001b[43Gso\u001b[46Gfar\u001b[50Gand\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58Gchosen\u001b[65Gtrade's\u001b[73G`estimate`\u001b[84Gare\u001b[88Gthe\u001b[92Gplayer's\u001b[101Gto\u001b[104Gsee\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1008 \u001b[22m   through the query's ship view and on reconnect.\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 1009 \u001b[22m - **NPC\u001b[21Gjobs.**\u001b[29GA\u001b[31Gscenario's\u001b[42G`traders`\u001b[52Gname\u001b[57GNPC\u001b[61Gprincipals\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gtheir\u001b[82Gcompanies,\u001b[93Gprovisioned\u001b[105Gin\u001b[108Gthe\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1010 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  initial state through `Company::Provision` at the starter venue\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m, each ship given an enabled policy,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 1011 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  their principals marked `World::Npc`, for which `manifest-token` issues no token. They read        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 1012 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  their own reports, seeded as a player's are. Autopilot is the job's travel; no route mode.         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 1010 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  initial state\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m,\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m \u001b[48;2;4;71;0mafter the first quotes, \u001b[48;2;2;40;0mthrough `Company::Provision` at the starter venue           \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1011 +\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m(`Policy::ProvisionTraders`), each ship given an enabled policy, its target and allowance 0, and   \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m1012 +\u001b[15G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtheir principals marked the world's own (`World::Principal`'s `npc`), as whom the server admits    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1013 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  no client whatever the token file holds. The content check leaves the starter a pad and a          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1014 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  life-support connection beyond the traders' for a player. They read their own reports, seeded as   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 1015 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  a player's are. Autopilot is the job's travel; no route mode.                                      \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 1016 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Its\u001b[21Gquiet.**\u001b[30GThe\u001b[34Gcurrent\u001b[42Gstep\u001b[47Gwhile\u001b[53Gan\u001b[56Genabled\u001b[64Gjob\u001b[68Ghas\u001b[72Ga\u001b[74Gdecision\u001b[83Gdue,\u001b[88Gits\u001b[92Gretry\u001b[98Gstep\u001b[103Gwhile\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m 1017 \u001b[22m   blocked, never othe\u001b[35Gwis\u001b[39G: travel's quiet wakes\u001b[62Gthe world for an arrival.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 1018 \u001b[13G\u001b[22m-\u001b[15G**Jettison.**\u001b[29GNo\u001b[32Ggap\u001b[36Gis\u001b[39Gexpected:\u001b[49Gcommands\u001b[58Gsent\u001b[63Gfrom\u001b[68Ga\u001b[70Gsystem,\u001b[78Gthe\u001b[82Gquiet\u001b[88Gand\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gdocks\u001b[102Gare\u001b[106Gpublic.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern…\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
